    [CI] Install CANN 9.3.0 ops-transformer packages (#20151)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Install the CANN 9.3.0 ops-transformer packages in the A2, A3, and A5
    Docker images, following the v0.27 installation flow.
    
    - A2 uses the `910b` package.
    - A3 uses the `A3` package.
    - A5 uses the `950` package.
    - Covers both Ubuntu and openEuler Dockerfiles.
    - Supports both aarch64 (`linux/arm64`) and x86_64 (`linux/amd64`)
    images.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. This only updates the container image build process.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`
    - Verified the six Dockerfiles use the expected A2/A3/A5 identifiers and
    the v0.27 installer flags: `--full --quiet --install-for-all`.
    - Verified all A2, A3, and A5 x86_64 package endpoints return HTTP 200.
    - Previously verified the supplied A3 aarch64 endpoint and matching A5
    endpoint return HTTP 200.
    - Docker image builds were not run locally because this Windows host
    does not provide the Ascend/NPU build environment.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/544f182d9f0c9bfe8bd7645525951d5e3692a542
    
    Signed-off-by: underfituu <hzhucong@163.com>

diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile
index 91f17e722..98be00813 100644
--- a/Dockerfile
+++ b/Dockerfile
@@ -18,6 +18,21 @@ FROM swr.cn-north-12.myhuaweicloud.com/atlas_inference/cann:9.2.0_20261022115200
 
 WORKDIR /workspace
 
+# Install CANN 910B (A2) ops-transformer package.
+ARG TARGETPLATFORM
+RUN ARCH=${TARGETPLATFORM:-$(uname -m)}; \
+    case "$ARCH" in \
+        "linux/arm64"|"aarch64") \
+            OPS_TRANSFORMER_URL="https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/package/master/20261028/aarch64/cann-910b-ops-transformer_9.3.0_linux-aarch64.run" ;; \
+        "linux/amd64"|"x86_64") \
+            OPS_TRANSFORMER_URL="https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/package/master/20261028/x86_64/cann-910b-ops-transformer_9.3.0_linux-x86_64.run" ;; \
+        *) echo "Skipping unsupported architecture: $ARCH" && exit 0 ;; \
+    esac && \
+    wget --quiet "$OPS_TRANSFORMER_URL" -O /tmp/cann-910b-ops-transformer.run && \
+    chmod +x /tmp/cann-910b-ops-transformer.run && \
+    /tmp/cann-910b-ops-transformer.run --full --quiet --install-for-all && \
+    rm -f /tmp/cann-910b-ops-transformer.run
+
 # Install clang-15 (for triton-ascend)
 RUN apt-get update -y && \
     apt-get install -y git vim wget curl protobuf-compiler libprotobuf-dev net-tools gcc g++ cmake numactl libnuma-dev libibverbs-dev libhiredis-dev clang-15 && \
